					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
		<p>Select <menucascade><uicontrol>Settings</uicontrol><uicontrol>Vehicle</uicontrol><uicontrol>Driver assistance</uicontrol></menucascade> on the infotainment system screen to set the Driver Assistance function.</p>
